==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|baignier}}, from {{inh|fr|VL.||*baneare}} {{inh|fr|LL.|balneāre}}, from {{inh|fr|la|balneum}}, and probably later influenced by the related French {{m|fr|bain}}. Compare Occitan {{m|oc|banhar}}, Catalan {{m|ca|banyar}}, Italian {{m|it|bagnare}}, Spanish {{m|es|bañar}}, Portuguese {{m|pt|banhar}}.

